    <mj-text padding="0px 20px 10px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <h3 style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">Business</h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-table
  font-family="Arial"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  padding="0px 32px 5px 32px"
  style="width: 100%"
>
  <tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/may/14/jaguar-land-rover-annual-profit-falls-99-per-cent-us-tariffs-cyber-attack" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">Jaguar Land Rover’s annual gains have fallen by more than 99%, dropping from £2.5B to just £14M in the year to March</a>. The company blamed a difficult year shaped by US car tariffs, weaker demand, tougher competition in China, and a major cyber-attack that forced factories and systems to shut down for weeks. Revenue also fell to £22.9B, more than 20% lower than the previous year.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/may/14/hedge-fund-proposes-1bn-buyout-of-spire-uk-biggest-private-hospital-operator" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">Spire Healthcare’s board has backed a possible £1B buyout proposal from Toscafund Asset Management, its second-largest shareholder</a>. It values Spire at 250p per share and sent the company’s shares up nearly 50%. Spire runs 38 private hospitals and more than 60 clinics across the UK, with nearly a third of revenue coming from NHS work. Toscafund must make a firm decision by 11 June.
  </td>
</tr>
</mj-table>

  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-spacer height="20px" />
<mj-section background-color="#eff1f4" padding="1px 1px 1px 1px" border-radius="10px">
