    <mj-text padding="20px 20px 10px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <h3 style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">Art &amp; culture</h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-table
  font-family="Arial"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  padding="0px 32px 0px 32px"
  style="width: 100%"
>
  <tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.msn.com/en-gb/news/world/tracey-emin-debuts-intimate-new-prints-at-london-art-fair/ar-AA23biSp?ocid=BingNewsVerp" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">Tracey Emin has unveiled a series of six intimate lithographs called “I Need Tomorrow” at the London Original Print Fair in Somerset House</a>. The prints show Emin in her raw, emotional style and are being displayed alongside her major Tate Modern retrospective, “A Second Life.” Emin said the series began almost accidentally while she was waiting to proof another print, and that it became a personal “gift” to herself.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment/documentary-film-on-odia-artist-prafulla-mohanti-wins-award-at-uk-asian-film-festival-101778748908230.html" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">Kolkata-born filmmaker Soumya Jyoti Pratihari’s documentary Shunya: Being Prafulla Mohanti has bagged the Tongues on Fire Flame Award for best LGBTQIA film</a> at the UK Asian Film Festival. The film had its world premiere at Riverside Studios in London on May 6. It follows 91-year-old Odia artist, writer, architect, and cultural thinker Prafulla Mohanti, tracing his journey from Odisha to Mumbai and later Britain. The documentary explores identity, migration, racism, spirituality, love, ageing, illness, and creativity.
  </td>
</tr>
</mj-table>
<mj-text padding="20px 20px 10px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <h3 style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">Sports</h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-table
  font-family="Arial"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  padding="0px 32px 0px 32px"
  style="width: 100%"
>
  <tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.bbc.com/sport/tennis/articles/cj0pyg469djo" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">Jannik Sinner has reached the Italian Open semi-finals after beating Andrey Rublev 6-2, 6-4 and breaking Novak Djokovic’s record for successive ATP Masters 1000 match victories</a>. The triumph was Sinner’s 32nd straight at the Masters level, continuing a dominant run before the French Open. He has reached the semi-finals at each of the first five Masters 1000 events this season, joining Rafael Nadal in that achievement.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/articles/cyv2nl9vl72o" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">The Championship play-off final between Southampton and Hull City may not go ahead as planned on Saturday, 23 May</a>, due to an EFL investigation into a Spygate case involving Southampton. The club has been charged with breaking rules after allegedly observing Middlesbrough’s training session before their semi-final first leg. An Independent Disciplinary Commission hearing will take place by Tuesday, 19 May.
  </td>
</tr>
</mj-table>
<mj-text padding="20px 20px 10px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <h3 style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">Misc</h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-table
  font-family="Arial"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
